{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We fused roguelike deckbuilders and autobattlers to create a whole new experience. Pick your favorite weapon, craft yourself a unique deck, create your unique playstyle, and play powerful cards to influence the outcome of the battle in a unique combat style where your Hero\u2019s actions are your resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/f77b139f44266ee230db83651c8793de.poster.avif?t=1771093736\" width=700 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/f77b139f44266ee230db83651c8793de.webm?t=1771093736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/353987166027f0bfb0a7f44d7b4807e2.poster.avif?t=1771093736\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/353987166027f0bfb0a7f44d7b4807e2.webm?t=1771093736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/353987166027f0bfb0a7f44d7b4807e2.mp4?t=1771093736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique turn-based combat system with autobattler elements. You and your enemy take turns executing a specific pattern of actions, with what happens on each action determined based on the character, the weapon they have, and the powers they have unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/26a093d16d54a355b8194abaa9c4466e.poster.avif?t=1771093736\" width=700 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/26a093d16d54a355b8194abaa9c4466e.webm?t=1771093736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/b8e169e9ed1ebba50e198ae4fc3f7e89.poster.avif?t=1771093736\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/b8e169e9ed1ebba50e198ae4fc3f7e89.webm?t=1771093736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/b8e169e9ed1ebba50e198ae4fc3f7e89.mp4?t=1771093736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Influence the outcome of the battle through game changing cards you play from a deck you handcraft throughout your run. In a unique autobattler combat system where the actions of the characters are the resources your card consume and interact with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/0927300b8d2f234946967946571a3bac.poster.avif?t=1771093736\" width=700 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/0927300b8d2f234946967946571a3bac.webm?t=1771093736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/53f2fdbef4c232bd45a1c81160c4952c.poster.avif?t=1771093736\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/53f2fdbef4c232bd45a1c81160c4952c.webm?t=1771093736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/53f2fdbef4c232bd45a1c81160c4952c.mp4?t=1771093736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and create your own unique playstyle from an assortment of gadgets, combat styles and  weapons you can equip and unlock throughout the game. With each offering its own unique and game changing way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/18a806891732a1b4817ecce63500b103.poster.avif?t=1771093736\" width=700 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/18a806891732a1b4817ecce63500b103.webm?t=1771093736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD </strong>your unique playstyle as you combo together different weapons, gadgets, and power cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER </strong>the unique mix of autobattler and turn based combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERCOME </strong>different challenges as you face stronger enemies wielding powerful weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLOCK </strong>new weapons, cards, and powerful gadgets with every run.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015800?t=1771093736","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/b1b9c83a8d56f9f1484995f3506293ad7abe46da/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771093736","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/7e74cb4d8b0aba1886930b2340c7ea54e70a95d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771093736","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/7e74cb4d8b0aba1886930b2340c7ea54e70a95d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771093736","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We fused roguelike deckbuilders and autobattlers to create a whole new experience. Pick your favorite weapon, craft yourself a unique deck, create your unique playstyle, and play powerful cards to influence the outcome of the battle in a unique combat style where your Hero\u2019s actions are your resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015800/extras/f77b139f44266ee230db83651c8793de.poster.